                      "star destroyer", "imperial", "warhammer", "xenomorph", "borg", "klingon", "dalek", "zerg", "tyranid",
                      "galactica", "halo", "covenant", "reaper", "sauron", "nazgul"]
 },
 "prompts": {
  "hero_qwen": "Redraw image 1 as a finished, detailed painted game sprite of a monstrous demonic gargoyle warship seen from above and in front, with exactly the materials, colours and style of image 2: dark violet-grey carved stone armour plating with panel lines and rivets, ivory bone horns, tusks and fangs, two glowing ember-orange eyes, a dark fanged maw in the middle, two dark rectangular hangar bays, dark bat-wing membranes on bone fingers, a gothic stone tower with lit slit windows, small red and amber running lights. Keep the outline, every shape, the pose and the viewing angle of image 1 exactly. Solid flat green background (#00FF00), no checkerboard, no shadow.",
  "hero_qwen_single": "Repaint this grey clay model as a finished, detailed painted game sprite of a monstrous demonic gargoyle warship seen from above and in front: dark violet-grey carved stone armour plating with panel lines and rivets, ivory bone horns, tusks and fangs, the two white shapes become glowing ember-orange eyes, the black rectangles become a dark fanged maw and two dark hangar bays, dark bat-wing membranes stretched on the bone fingers, a gothic stone tower with lit slit windows, small red and amber running lights. Keep the outline, every shape, the pose and the viewing angle exactly. Solid flat green background (#00FF00), no checkerboard, no shadow.",
  "hero_sdxl": "game sprite of a monstrous demonic gargoyle warship, seen from above and in front, dark violet-grey carved stone armour plating, ivory bone horns and fangs, glowing ember-orange eyes, dark fanged maw, dark hangar bays, bat-wing membranes on bone fingers, gothic tower with lit windows, hard surface, intricate, menacing, flat green background",
  "negative": "text, letters, watermark, logo, signature, ui, frame, border, blurry, photo, photorealistic, multiple views, character sheet, grid, sky, horizon, ground, landscape, scenery, checkerboard, shadow, cyan, teal, blue lights, skull, skulls, cross, crucifix, religious symbol, scripture, inscription, human crew, real military vehicle, cute, cartoon"
 },
